"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Faktureringappen:</font></b> Bevar et "
"overskueligt overblik over alle dine fakturaer."

#. module: catering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:catering.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">The Project &amp; Planning Apps:</font></"
"b> Manage event-related tasks and track their progress through customizable "
"stages."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Projekt- og Planlægningsapps:</font></b> "
"Administrér begivenhedsrelaterede opgaver, og følg deres fremskridt gennem "
"tilpassede faser."

#. module: catering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:catering.welcome_article_body
